"Match an installed application's name, ignoring case. app: is also accepted." = "匹配已安装应用的名称，忽略大小写，也可使用 app:。";
"Match an exact source bundle identifier, including apps no longer installed." = "精确匹配来源 Bundle ID，也适用于已卸载的应用。";
